(Sihanoukville): The case of kidnapping the same Chinese man for $ 170,000 at De Grand Mansion Villa in Village 5, Sangkat 4, Sihanoukville, Preah Sihanouk Province has been investigated by the Preah Sihanouk Provincial Gendarmerie. Successfully arrested three perpetrators, sent to court, confiscated $ 100,000, but unfortunately the victims were killed.
The search operation continued throughout the week under the direct command of General Sao Sokha, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Commander of the National Gendarmerie, with the coordination of the Sihanoukville, Takeo and Phnom Penh Prosecutors. As well as cooperation with relevant authorities.
After that, the Sihanoukville Provincial Armed Forces expanded the territory to Phnom Penh, in cooperation with the Phnom Penh International Airport Gate Police, arrested the suspect, Zang Tanning, a 43-year-old Chinese man (mastermind) and brought him to Phnom Penh. Sihanoukville Provincial Gendarmerie Command to continue the procedure.
