ASEAN Capital Market Forum promotes securities issuance and investment in ASEAN capital markets
(Phnom Penh): The Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia (CSX) will chair the ASEAN Capital Market Forum (ACMF) 2022 with the support of the Asian Development Bank (ADB) and financial support from the Government of Japan. Organized an international conference on "The Sustainable Development Process of ASEAN Capital Markets: Promoting Environmental Recovery and Resilience" to promote securities issuance and investment in ASEAN Capital Markets.
The International Conference aims to promote the sustainable development, environment and recovery of ASEAN through the ASEAN Capital Markets, as well as the promotion of securities issuance and investment in the ASEAN Capital Markets.
