At present, China-ASEAN relations are at a critical stage to raise the level of leaps and bounds in the fields of politics, security, economic and trade cooperation and cultural exchanges. A solid foundation for bilateral relations to enhance the class.
In the future, China and ASEAN will continue to rely on their respective advantages to further deepen cooperation in mutual investment, infrastructure and international productivity. Vigorous bilateral economic and trade relations between China and ASEAN will effectively promote the regional economic integration process and contribute to the recovery of regional and global economies.
