The following is the Royal Decree of the King: The Ministry of Agriculture and the Cambodian Rice Federation jointly push to solve the problem of lack of rice varieties that correspond to the market.
(Phnom Penh): The new Minister of Agriculture, Mr. Dith Tina, and the Cambodian Rice Federation held the first meeting to solve the problem of rice seed production to supply farmers to ensure that farmers get reasonable prices, increase productivity and access. High profits as the seed issue has affected rice exports to international markets as well.
Speaking at a consultative meeting on rice seed production and rice exports on October 31, 2022, Mr. Dith Tina said that solving the problem of rice seeds is one of the strategies of the Ministry of Agriculture to strengthen production. Strengthen the internal from 2023 before seeking additional external markets to boost rice export movement.
He added that this seed production project will promote how to get good rice varieties from May 2023. He urged private sector or exporters to contract with farmers in each region to supply seeds to market demand, but to offer a cheaper price than the current price of seeds.
Oknha Hun Lak, Chairman of the Board of the Rice Federation of Cambodia, said that the shortage of pure seeds made the supply of farmers to rice mills for processing and export, especially fragrant rice and romduol. He proposed developing strategies and plans to promote large-scale seed production with the participation of all parties, focusing on varieties that meet market demand.
Mr. Ngin Chhay, Director General of the General Department of Agriculture, said that in the past, rice seed production was not fully operational, producing only one part, without sufficient supply to the producers due to the work. Separately, other professionals, the private sector and the rice seed production community do different things, which have not yet been well integrated into the production chain, leaving Cambodia still facing rice seed problems.
He said that the use of pure seeds can increase the yield of rice by 5 to 20% can reduce the amount of seed consumption, high germination rate in the field and grow evenly, rice can grow evenly and strong. Fast growing and disease and pest resistance, good ripening rice, high yield and high yield percentage when grinding, low mixing rate of other seeds and weeds, high price rice in the market.
Mr. Say Sam Al made this statement on the occasion of presiding over the opening ceremony of the meeting to summarize the results of environmental work in 2022 and work direction 2023 of the Ministry of Environment, which will take place for two days from October 31. Until November 1, 2022.
