Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen Distributing Rice Seed and Food to Nearly 7,000 Families in Kampong Thom Province
(Kampong Thom): This morning, Saturday, October 29, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, distributed rice seeds and food to nearly 7,000 families in Kampong Thom province. The ceremony was held at Kampong Thom Provincial Football Stadium.
The people who came to receive rice seeds and food were 6,844 families from 9 cities, 48 districts, 29 communes and 298 villages. 684,400 kilograms of rice seeds will be given to the people, along with some food items, including rice, fish, noodles and some other budget.
The following are the main remarks of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
* As the beginning of the conversation, Samdech Techo Hun Sen brought the Royal Message of the King and Samdech Mey to the people of Kampong Thom Province.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that His Majesty the Prince of Life on the Stone and Samdech Mey always pay high attention to the well-being of the people.
* Today marks the 18th anniversary of the accession of the King of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen wishes to bless the King of Cambodia and states that during the 18 years of his reign And bring peace and well-being to the Cambodian people throughout the kingdom.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised and highly appreciated the relevant authorities in all areas together to solve the problems of the people during the flood.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that CPP officials are always close to the people in times of trouble.
While traveling by air, Samdech Techo Hun Sen observed that there was a lot of water in the rice fields, which was favorable for replanting rice.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded of the difficulties in the family of Samdech when faced with floods when Samdech was young. Samdech Techo reminded that Samdech's father shed tears when he dived to remove all the rotten rice.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that starting from this difficult experience made Samdech clearly understand the difficulties of the people and also made Samdech set out many policies to promote agriculture after Samdech became Prime Minister in 1985.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the people who voted for the CPP during the Commune / Sangkat Council elections and hoped to continue voting for the CPP in 2023.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked the people that when there is suffering, there is always help from CPP officials, why when voting for someone who just came down to speak?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the 2023 national budget is a budget to help people and for growth. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that in 2023, the Royal Government will continue to release a lot of money to feed the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the people for working together to fight Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on people to get vaccinated against Kovid 19 while the vaccine is still in stock about 8 million doses.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia adheres to the monarchy and must not allow insults to the King.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praises and praises the Candlelight Party for issuing a statement condemning the convict Sam Rainsy for insulting the King.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people not to join the group of traitors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he had invited Putin to attend the ASEAN Summit but had not yet responded.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked all political parties for coming out to condemn the traitors for insulting the King's power.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen finished his talk at 8 am on October 29, 2022. Thank you for watching the live broadcast on Fresh News TV. Today is the 10th day of the 2022 voter list and voter registration process. Please go and check the voter list and register to vote!
