Lt. Gen. E Sok Khy made the remarks during a meeting between the National Police General Commission and the private security service provider on the preparation of a security plan for the 3rd National Games 2022 and the direction of the Sea Games. Game 32nd, 2023. The meeting was held at the National Police General Commission with the participation of representatives of several private security service providers.
