(Kratie): The Ministry of Environment, in cooperation with the Kratie Provincial Administration, held a two-day seminar on disseminating laws related to the environment and natural resources from October 27 to 28, 2022.
The ceremony was held in the presence of Mr. Rath Virak, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Environment and Mr. Duong Pov, Deputy Governor of Kratie Province, highlighting the geography of 6 protected areas and the environment with a total area of 404,894 hectares that have been protected and Conservation.
