BEIJING (Xinhua) - The 20th Congress of the Communist Party of China (CPC) concluded with a standing ovation from the Chinese people and people around the world. Leaders from political parties, civil society representatives, and high-ranking intellectuals have elected a seven-member Standing Committee of the Politburo to represent China's top political power.
By consolidating the health of the people in the national strategy as a priority, the Chinese Communist Party, which originated from the people, gained power from the people, will continue its noble mission, everything is for the people to depend on the people, value The courage of the people creates new ideas and innovations and drives the cause forward for the benefit of the people and respect for the people's position, ensuring that the Chinese people own China.
The ideals of the Chinese Communist Party are lofty ideals and strategic tasks to maintain the political commitment to build a fully prosperous society and to restore the greatness of the Chinese nation. Adhering to an open spirit, China is firmly ready in close cooperation with all countries in the world to continue to produce cakes that benefit from development.
In addition, the spirit of multilateralism that China has always adhered to is existing as a common value of humanity, which is China's active part in maintaining peace, progress, justice, democracy and freedom to promote the building of a world of lasting peace. Security in general, prosperity, openness and environment.
Through this gene, Chinese-style modernization is a modernization that not only provides a prosperous life for the people, the harmony between material civilization and spiritual civilization, the harmony of coexistence. Only between man and nature and the peaceful development path of the Chinese people, humanity in the world is tasting and reaping the fruits of this great achievement.
The 20th Congress of the Communist Party of China (CPC) has given more confidence to Xi Jinping as Secretary-General, signaling that China is entering a new era on the highways for building China on a modern socialist path. Prosperity in all directions, smoothly achieving the goal of the second hundred years of struggle to restore the greatness of the Chinese nation.
"Dreams of prosperity, dreams of a strong country, dreams of China in general are the dreams of people's happiness."
(Phnom Penh): As of September 2022, more than 500,000 customers have used transactions in the Bakong system worth $ 1.2 billion. This is according to Ms. Chea Serey, Technical Director General of the National Bank of Cambodia.
Ms. Chea Serey stated that "transactions in the Bakong system amounted to $ 1.2 billion, while the number of direct and indirect transactions was about 2 million transactions, while the number of users of Bakong direct software is half a million."
Ms. Chea Serey said that the development and use of the Bakong system is now better because the Bongong system is facilitated for transferring money from one bank to another. Currently, the Bakong system has been added to a new system that allows people to exchange both riel and dollar.
The National Bank of Cambodia has partnered with Thailand for payments through Bakong and is currently studying collaborations with Vietnam and Laos.
She stated that the cooperation in using the Bakong system with neighboring countries has provided many benefits, such as: No need to exchange money or can pay money through existing accounts, but the money that can be paid is the account in riel.
Please be informed that the Bakong payment system developed by the National Bank of Cambodia is becoming a proud new achievement of Cambodia as this payment system is receiving a lot of attention and awards from professional economic and financial institutions. The world.
In 2021, transactions in riel through the payment system "Bakong" will be 2.5 trillion riel and the dollar will be 3 billion US dollars.
