(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chan Sokhon, Second Deputy of the Candlelight Party in Anlong Veng Commune, Anlong Veng District, Oddar Meanchey Province, issued a strong condemnation message to three generations of traitor Sam Rainsy, who used a serious insult to the power of the King of Cambodia. His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni.
In this condemnation message, Mr. Chan Sokhon emphasized, "We, the members of the whole Candlelight Party, we absolutely cannot accept the repeated insults of this traitor to him. The King. "We strongly condemn who dared to insult the King, the highest deity of the Khmer nation."
Mr. Chan Sokhon stated that the insult by accusing the King of the Kingdom of Cambodia, the head of state and the highest patriotic state of the Khmer nation, was treason was the most serious insult that could not be Absolutely tolerant.
The second deputy from the Candlelight Party has called on the Royal Government of Cambodia to take the strictest legal action against three generations of traitors and fugitives, as well as allies who have contributed to the insult to the King. There are no exceptions.
