(Kampong Chhnang): After completing a busy mission from Siem Reap on October 21, 2022 and will continue to the provinces adjacent to the Tonle Sap Lake, on Tuesday morning, October 25, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister Cambodia has arrived in Kampong Chhnang province, the former capital of Longvek.
Arriving in Kampong Chhnang, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has two missions, as in Banteay Meanchey, Battambang and Pursat. The first mission is to meet with government officials and the armed forces in Kampong Chhnang province at around 3 pm on Tuesday. Separately, the second mission is to distribute rice seeds and food to farmers affected by the flood, which will take place on Wednesday morning, October 26.
About 1,411 government officials and members of the armed forces in Kampong Chhnang province attended a meeting with Samdech Techo Hun Sen this afternoon.
Mr. Sun Sovannarith, Governor of Kampong Chhnang Province, expressed his great pleasure to receive the high presence of Samdech Techo, Head of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
"Today is the highest historical day that the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Administration has received the high presence of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia, who spent a busy and worthwhile visit. "Provincial councils, municipal councils, district councils, commune councils, civil servants and the armed forces are very close."
In this meeting, Mr. Governor informed Samdech Techo and the whole ceremony about some important information related to civil servants, territorial administration, security, public order, campaign to confiscate and manage 3 areas around Tonle Sap Lake, cutting work. Land clearing for the people, work to resolve disputes outside the judiciary, work to prevent and suppress fishing crimes and work to crack down on all kinds of gambling.
Mr. Sun Sovannarith said that the provincial, municipal and district administrations have implemented the policy of the Royal Government to maintain security, public order, aesthetics and development through the mechanism of the Board of Governors, Provincial Administrative Units and Communes. And committees of the third mandate provincial council.
The provincial governor also announced a campaign to confiscate and manage land in three areas around the Tonle Sap Lake. In the implementation of the campaign to confiscate flooded forest land in three areas around the Tonle Sap Lake, people volunteered to hand over land to a total of 7,531 families on a total area of 30,589 hectares.
Dissemination, Prevention and Suppression of Fishing Crimes The Provincial / Municipal Administrative Unity Command has educated the people related to fishing during the spawning season, the ban on the use of illegal fishing gear, and promoted the movement for the use of fishing tackle by volunteers. The joint task force to crack down on illegal fishing in the area confiscated and destroyed all kinds of illegal fishing gear.
On behalf of the Provincial Board of Governors, monks, government officials, the armed forces and the people of Kampong Chhnang province, Mr. Sun Sovannarith expressed his sincere gratitude to Samdech Techo for his outstanding heroic example of leading the country's liberation struggle. The nation seeks peace, unites the nation, builds and develops the nation for progress in all areas in the cause of the nation, peace, well-being, prosperity and progress of Cambodia.
On behalf of the Provincial Council of Governors, Monks, Government Officials, the Armed Forces and the People of Kampong Chhnang Province, Mr. Sun Sovannarith solemnly and fully supported the decision of the General Assembly of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party to continue to support Samdech Techo Hun Sen will be the Prime Minister and Dr. Hun Manet will be the Prime Minister for the future.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also praised officials at all levels of Kampong Chhnang province who have worked together to develop this province to grow. CRC Branch in Tbong Khmum Province Holds a Meeting to Summarize 9 Month Achievements and Work Directions for the 4th Quarter of 2022
