Physical effects of drugs Drug use also has serious effects on the whole body, such as fatigue, exhaustion, emaciation and organs such as eyes, nose, ears, heart, liver, brain, degenerative muscles, weak and vulnerable. Get various diseases such as chronic cough, bronchitis, encephalitis, lung cancer, reproductive dysfunction and so on.
