The three-day consultation will be held from October 24 to 26, 2022, with the participation of ASEAN delegates, EU delegates, civil society and national human rights institutions to strengthen ASEAN-EU cooperation. On human rights in Jakarta, Indonesia.
During the dialogue, Mr. Jean Malin gave an opening speech as the keynote speaker and facilitated consultative discussions on topics related to the human rights situation in ASEAN and Europe, as well as the possibility of ASEAN-EU cooperation. Promote human rights in both regions.
In addition, Jean Malin also had a bilateral meeting with EU Special Representative for Human Rights Eamon Gilmore, discussing the overview of the human rights situation and law enforcement in Cambodia and strengthening human rights cooperation between the two countries. Cambodia and the European Union.
