For the total population living in the United States is more than 332 million people. Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen handed over rice seeds to more than 5,000 families in Pursat
Pursat is also a province that has been severely flooded due to flooding and runoff from other areas. On the occasion of distributing rice seeds, Samdech Techo Hun Sen spoke for about 40 minutes. The following is the main content:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised and appreciated the authorities, the Armed Forces and all the people who worked together to solve and overcome the flood problem.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commended Senior Minister Kun Kim and Minister of Agriculture for their joint efforts to address the floods and the rehabilitation of rice and other crops.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government has not ignored the suffering of the people. In the local authorities, in cooperation with the national authorities and the Red Cross, they worked closely to solve the problem.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that climate change has created serious problems for Cambodia, the region and the world.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that food security is a short-term solution, but providing rice seeds to farmers is a long-term solution.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he expects farmers to try to grow crops again after getting rice seeds.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen brought the royal message of the King and Samdech Mey to all the affected people in Pursat province.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs the authorities to pay attention to the distribution of food to farmers affected by the floods.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked all the benefactors who participated in solving the difficulties of the flood victims with the Royal Government. This is the culture of sharing in Cambodian society.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also expressed his gratitude and thanks to the monks and people who participated in solving the people's problems during the floods.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government is not bankrupt yet, but the participation of the people makes the Royal Government more able to help the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the people of Pursat Province as well as throughout the country for voting for the Cambodian People's Party to win the landslide election. Especially the people of Pursat who have the highest support rate.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Kovid 19 has brought difficulties to Cambodia, but the people's combined victory with peace and political stability has made Cambodia overcome the difficulties due to Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on monks and people to stand up against traitors who insult the Khmer King.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the Cambodian people to stand up against the three generations of traitors Sam Rainsy, not to let this traitor destroy the nation, destroy religion and the King.
