General Kun Kim, Senior Minister in charge of Special Missions and First Vice Chairman of the National Committee for Disaster Management, said that Samdech Techo had ordered him and the Minister of Agriculture, as well as the provincial governor and other stakeholders to organize work in Prey Veng province. Night. According to the Senior Minister, last night Samdech Techo rested the least.
Through his work, General Kun Kim noted that Samdech Techo Hun Sen paid great attention to the well-being of the people. Despite being tired and busy on missions in the provinces around the Tonle Sap Lake, Samdech could not delay the distribution of rice seeds to help people restore rice farming in time.
It should be noted that Samdech Techo Hun Sen started his working mission in the provinces around Tonle Sap Lake on October 21, 2022 by meeting with people who volunteered to move construction from the Angkor resort area. After completing two days of work in Siem Reap on October 22, Samdech Techo traveled to Banteay Meanchey to meet with government officials and the armed forces and distribute rice seeds to flood-affected farmers.
This activity also took place the next day in Battambang, Pursat and will end this mission in Kampong Chhnang on October 26.
Russia's oil supplies to China rise 22% in September
SINGAPORE: Chinese oil imports from Russia rose 22 percent in September from a year earlier, but were still lower than those from Saudi Arabia as refiners bought oil. Russia at a much lower price. According to Reuters.
Reuters reports, citing data released by the Chinese Customs Administration on Monday, that supplies from Russia include oil pumped through pipelines in the Siberian-Pacific Ocean and by sea from European and Far Eastern ports. Russia has a total of 7.45 million tons.
Imports of crude oil from Saudi Arabia's top supplier reached 7.53 million tonnes, or 1.83 million barrels a day, up from 1.99 million barrels a day in August, down 5.4 percent from a year earlier. Quantities imported in September last year.
In the first nine months, Saudi Arabia topped the list with 65.84 million tons of oil sales to China, down 1 percent from a year earlier. Russia's exports to China rose nearly 9 percent to 64.26 million tons. According to Reuters.
(Kratie): A society, a community that can grow and develop requires the participation of all cells of society, can not rely only on this institution or institution. Based on this spirit, the trainees of the 2022 Senior Officials Training Course at Nokor Phnom level raised about 15,000 USD for the Royal School of Administration to participate in the construction of Trapeang Treang Primary School in Trapeang Treang Village, Changkong Commune, Chit Borei District, Kratie Province.
