The actual situation in the area is not only affected by the floods but also the problem of red snails destroying rice. According to the farmers, due to the problem of red snails, they are forced to use more rice varieties to cut with the destruction of this snail, so they have to spend more in the laying stage. Fertilizer.
Farmers also raised a number of issues that make farming less profitable due to the high cost of fertilizers and pesticides, plus other labor costs.
