Preah Vihear: Four more Chinese nationals were arrested by joint police forces after attempting to cross the border into Laos illegally through the Kampong Sralao border crossing in Cheb district, Preah Vihear province, this morning, October 23, 2022.
Before arresting the four Chinese nationals, the police patrolled the area with suspicion and stopped a sedan with license plate number 2AY 4971, driven by Men Ratana, male, 27 years old, living in Dong Tong village. In Dambok Khpos commune, Angkor Chey district, Kampot province, there were 4 Chinese nationals and 1 female in the car who illegally crossed the border into Laos. According to the authorities.
At present, the four Chinese nationals and a Cambodian car driver have been sent to court for legal action.
It should be noted that on October 18, 2022, the joint police force stationed at the Kampong Sralao border checkpoint also arrested 16 Chinese nationals and 2 Cambodian nationals who were trying to cross the border into Laos by mistake. Law. The 16 Chinese nationals were sent back to China through the Siem Reap airport, while two nationals were sent to Preah Vihear Provincial Court for pretrial detention.
