Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked the signatories of the Paris Agreement: "Does the Paris Agreement provide for the prosecution of the Khmer Rouge?"
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also stated that analysts who ran naked during the agreement are posing as experts on the Paris Agreement. According to Samdech Techo, a win-win policy ended Cambodia's war without the use of ammunition.
