(Phnom Penh): In accordance with the spirit of the Extraordinary Meeting of the Council of the Cambodian Intellectual Property Association on October 20, 2022, the President of the Association and the members of the Council decided to postpone the candidacy of the Council and the President of the Intellectual Property Association of Cambodia. Third mandate until December 30, 2022.
