The Cambodia Securities Exchange 2022, which lasts for three days, on October 21, 22 and 23, 2022, is organized for the following main purposes:
1: Continue to promote and increase the confidence of existing investors to continue to trust the Cambodian stock market through face-to-face meetings with securities listed companies.
2: Provide opportunities for the public to have a broader understanding of investing in the market, such as opening a trading account, reviewing the company's financial statements and market data, understanding of trading methods and dividend distribution, as well as other topics. Related to the entire stock exchange.
3: The official launch of the online trading account opening system: This system is a new step of the Cambodia Securities Exchange, which allows investors to open an account anywhere, which can facilitate more investors and increase trading as well. Shows another level of progress in financial technology in the securities sector.
4: Official launch of the second generation "PhsarHun" mobile app. This app is updated from the first generation app, adding some new features that allow investors to understand the stock market more easily.
This second generation program has become an important channel for the public to start learning about the stock market, find a securities company, open a trading account, monitor stock prices and get more information.
5: Official launch of a special promotion package for new investors and promote the opening of trading accounts by providing the public with free investor identification and trading accounts and a 50% discount on commissions until the end of 2022.
6: Awarding the winners of the 5th Stock Trading Competition, which was held from March 22, 2021 to June 17, 2021 in order to promote trading and provide new knowledge and experience for investors.
While the market index has fallen by almost 15% during this competitive period, about 35% of investors still have a positive profit margin and our champion investors have received a profit margin of 41.45%, which shows See that smart investors can find investment opportunities and can effectively manage risk in all market conditions.
Mr. Sou Socheat highly appreciated the organization of the Stock Exchange Fair, which is a driving force in promoting the development of the capital market in Cambodia.
Mr. Sou Socheat said that the securities market in Cambodia is in the context of rapid growth in terms of legal structure, market structure, issuers, as well as the number of national and international investors. Therefore, all stakeholders must work together to develop the market in line with the acceleration of market demand.
At the same time, raising awareness and disseminating to the public in order to attract, increase investor confidence, invest more and encourage potential companies to list in the market, which is a necessary factor for the progress of the Cambodia Securities Exchange. Welfare.
On behalf of the Ministry of Economy and Finance and Chairman of the Board of Directors of the Stock Exchange of Cambodia, the Secretary of State supports these necessary activities and requests the relevant parties to consider additional possibilities to facilitate investors to invest in a Friendly Environment. , Effective with hedging.
