(Phnom Penh): The National Bank of Cambodia and the Commission for the Kovid 19 Vaccination in Provinces Nationwide (CCV 19) on October 21, 2022, signed a Memorandum of Understanding on the use of the Bakong system to find Kovid vaccination information 19 that is convenient for each individual.
