Ms. Chea Serey stated that digital technology has become the most potential driving force for economic growth in both the regional and global framework in response to the current economic and financial growth of the National Bank of Cambodia. Also developed Bakong system as a payment system that facilitates cross-institutional payment transactions with the following goals:
