(Phnom Penh): Mr. Ly Chantola, President of the Bar Association of Cambodia, said that despite some positive changes, respect and recognition of the rights of lawyers at the judicial police level in the case of a preliminary investigation into a felony remains a challenge. Same.
In a press conference at the Bar Association on the morning of October 20, 2022, Mr. Ly Chantola claimed that this is one of many challenges. However, the President of the Bar Association claims that the issue of judicial police officers still does not respect the exercise of the rights of lawyers in the case of this obvious crime, some improvements have been made in the past, but still continue, while lawyers always ask for help to solve .
Mr. Ly Chantola also stated that the case of his lawyer accompanying his client is one of the points stated in Article 1 and Article 2 of the Law on the Law on Lawyers regarding the right to assist clients at all stages of the proceedings. The presence of a lawyer is not an obstacle to the performance of the work of a judicial police officer, but the presence of a lawyer strengthens the quality and recognition of the case of a judicial police officer to the prosecutor or the court.
He added that another problem is that some rights of lawyers have been violated and some affairs of lawyers have been mediated in some institutions, such as the courts and ministries and some professional institutions.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Ly Chantola, President of the Bar Association of Cambodia for the 14th mandate, on October 20, 2022, stated that the Bar Association is considering establishing medals and awarding to lawyers who have made outstanding achievements in helping The Bar Association of Lawyers and Social Justice, while 218 volunteer lawyers are defending the poor free of charge.
Speaking at a press conference at the Bar Association after the official inauguration on October 20, 2022, Mr. Ly Chantola stated: "So far, I have led a draft decision on the establishment of equipment. Honors for five types of lawyers.
According to Mr. Ly Chantola, there are five medals: excellence, merit, loyalty, sociality and remembrance. When it comes to awarding medals to prominent lawyers, he mentions more legal aid mechanisms for the poor.
The President of the Bar Association also pointed out the direction in his ninth point, adding that he will continue to review, decide and set up a mechanism to implement the decision on the honor of the Bar Association of the Kingdom of Cambodia to provide outstanding lawyers in Assist the Bar Association, the legal profession and social justice affairs.
According to the report on the one-year progress of the 13th Bar Association, in response to Mr. Ly Chantola's call to participate in defending the poor free of charge, 218 volunteer lawyers participated. As a result, as of September 2022, the Bar Association has assigned lawyers to help defend the poor for free in 88 cases with 112 clients (27 women and 15 minors).
All expenses incurred in the implementation of this project are the responsibility of the entire volunteer lawyer, not affecting the budget sponsored by the Royal Government or the budget of the Bar Association.
According to the report, there are currently 310 volunteer lawyers participating in the project. The location of this policy legal advice can be obtained by visiting the Department of Defense for the Poor of the Bar Association, the Office of the Provincial / Provincial Bar Delegation, the Phnom Penh Court of Appeal, the Regional Court of Appeal and the Supreme Court and the Professional Office. Volunteer Lawyer or via Hotline: 1281.
At the same time, the Bar Association also announced the list of lawyers, locations, volunteer lawyers and telephone numbers to the public. As a result, as of September 2022, 483 cases of legal advice were provided to the people.
Please be informed that Mr. Keut Rith, Minister of Justice, said that the lawyer who has been defending the poor more and more responsibly will gain the honor, reputation and respect in the society. Also.
"Obviously, a lawyer who has given more protection to the poor and is more responsible will gain the honor, reputation and respect of the society as well as the people," he said. "Both poor people and the general population, which is an important factor in strengthening the excellence and prestige of the legal profession."
Minister of Agriculture: Agricultural policy for the future, not to increase the price of agricultural products, but to make farmers more profitable
(Kampong Cham): Mr. Dith Tina, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, on October 20, 2022, stated that the agricultural policy in the future is not to increase the price of agricultural products, but to To make farmers more profitable.
This confirmation was made on the occasion of Mr. Dith Tina distributing rice seeds to 497 families equal to 33 tons of rice seeds in 4 communes, Kampong Siem district, Kampong Cham province on the morning of October 20. This year 2022.
"What I am thinking about in the future, as an agricultural policy, is not to push up agricultural prices and cause hardship to many more people who need food," he said. "Farmers reduce production costs to get more profit."
At the same time, Mr. Dith Tina also told the farmers not to be deceived by the deceitful politicians who told the farmers that they would increase the price of agricultural products when they came to see the farmers, but when they went to meet the workers, they promised That would make agricultural products cheaper, which is not possible unless the politician pays for it himself.
In addition, on behalf of the new Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries wants to see farmers can reduce the cost of production, he claimed that the Ministry is working hard with skills.
Please be informed that in the press conference on October 17, 2022, after announcing the new Minister of Agriculture, Mr. Dith Tina stated that his vision is to lead the Cambodian agricultural sector to become "modern agriculture".
