(Phnom Penh): The Bar Association of Cambodia has announced that the press conference on the announcement of the inauguration of the President of the Bar Association of the 14th mandate and the work plan and direction of the second mandate of Mr. Ly Chantola, President of the Bar Association of the 14th mandate will be Held on October 20, 2022 tomorrow.
