1: The announcement of the re-appointment as the President of the Bar Association of the 14th mandate of Mr. Ly Chantola.
2: Work plan and direction in the second mandate of Mr. Ly Chantola, President of the Bar Association in the 14th mandate.
Mr. Ly Chantola, President of the Bar Association of Cambodia, 13th mandate, was re-elected President of the Bar Association of Cambodia for the 14th mandate after the election was held on October 16, 2022 from 9:30 am to 12 noon. : 30 minutes noon.
According to the results announced at 3:00 pm after the closing of the vote count, Mr. Ly Chantola received the largest number of votes up to 2016, or 98.58%.
This election has no complaints and no irregularities. There were 2,045 election lawyers, including 1,640 direct voters and 405 delegated voters. Of all the ballots, 2016 were valid, while 29 were invalid.
