(Phnom Penh): Ms. Dam Darini, Secretary of State and Chief of Gender Affairs of the Ministry of National Defense, stated that Cambodia, under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, has promoted women in all areas, especially in the field of women's defense. Given appropriate positions in affairs, territorial integrity, and people like men.
Dam Darini made the remarks while giving an interview to the media during a meeting with female soldiers of the Air Force Command this morning, October 19, 2022.
She said that in order to improve the status of women in the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, the Ministry of National Defense has established a Gender Working Group and has taken care to promote the status and position of women in accordance with the competent skills and needs of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces.
Ms. Dam Darini said: "As for the defense sector, we are talking about the role of women, since the women's structure under the Ministry of Defense, the Commander-in-Chief and the various types of troops are actively involved in the work. "National defense."
The Secretary of State continued that in addition to the core duties in the Ministry of National Defense, women soldiers have been actively involved with the Royal Government in carrying out humanitarian work.
Ms. Dam Darini added: "In the military sector, the role of women has taken on many important positions, including women as secretaries of state, undersecretaries of state, women commanders-in-chief, military police headquarters and subordinate units. "And we will work to empower women who have contributed to the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces."
As a female leader of the Ministry of National Defense, Ms. Dam Darini urged female soldiers in the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF) to strive to develop important technical skills like men in order to improve the quality of their contribution to unit development as well as defense. Nation and so on.
