BEIJING, Oct. 16 (Xinhua) - The 20th Congress of the Communist Party of China (CPC) was launched on October 16, 2022, and the world is watching closely to join in the celebration of new achievements. The congress is full of momentum in the current of global development, the most important initiative of the Chinese Communist Party, with Xi Jinping at its core.
Since its establishment on July 1, 1921, the Communist Party of China has fulfilled its commitment with great commitment and solemnity to the history and nation of China in achieving the first goal of the century to build A moderately prosperous society in all areas, especially the eradication of poverty in China, with an estimated 96 million people living in poverty.
The world is applauding the 20th Congress of the Communist Party of China, the outcome of which will expand the scope of the initiatives highlighted by Xi Jinping and has become a philosophy of global development in China. The acceleration of the miraculous process is to encourage the prosperous Chinese nation to join forces with pride in building China on the path of socialism, modernization and prosperity.
Chinese-style socialism is unleashing new vitality in the 21st century, the right choice in line with the path of development in the noble cause of political stability, peacekeeping and human development. The road to achieving the second goal of the century is to restore the greatness of the Chinese nation.
(Phnom Penh): General Chhum Socheat, Secretary of State and Spokesperson of the Ministry of National Defense, this morning, October 18, 2022, announced the firm position of the army to protect the legitimate government led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen. The Prime Minister of Cambodia in all circumstances.
