Read the press release below: Report of the 20th Congress of the Communist Party of China: China will strive to build a common community of human destiny, call for the promotion of common values of humanity
Xi Jinping said that the transformation of the century is unfolding in an unprecedented way. On the one hand, the current of peaceful history, the development of win-win cooperation can not be prevented, on the other hand, the act of supremacy is extremely dangerous.
He said China adheres to building a new type of international relations based on the five principles of peaceful coexistence and pioneering global partnership. Xi Jinping said that China adheres to the national policy of openness, and strictly implements a mutually beneficial and win-win open strategy, and promotes greater trade and investment in trade and investment. Easy to defend protectionism against unilateral sanctions.
China is willing to increase investment in development resources and global cooperation, strive to reduce the gap between developing and developed countries, and strongly support and assist developing countries to accelerate development.
Xi Jinping said in the report that China has echoed the Global Development Initiative and the Global Security Initiative, and is happy to work with the international community. China sincerely calls on all countries in the world to promote the common values of humanity, peace, development, justice, truth, democracy and freedom, and respect for the diversity of world cultures, to jointly address all global issues.
