Commentary: Interpretation of modernization of Chinese style
Xi Jinping commented on the features and realities of Chinese-style modernization in the report of the 20th Congress of the Communist Party of China (CPC). With the feature of combining the modernization experience of countries with Chinese personal features.
Chinese-style modernization is a modernization that covers a huge population, a modernization in which all people enjoy a prosperous life, a modernization of material civilization and civilization. A harmonious spirit is a modernization in which humanity and nature coexist harmoniously and is a modernization that follows the path of peaceful development.
Reporting at the 20th Congress of the Communist Party of China, Xi Jinping stressed that nature is a fundamental condition of human life and development. Respect for nature, adapt to nature and protect nature are the requirements of building a modern socialist country in all aspects. In addition, modernization in the Chinese style will bring many benefits in areas such as modern technology. Human resource exchange and so on.
