(Preah Vihear): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, donated 200 tons of rice to be distributed to flood victims in the northwestern provinces.
