Mr. Say Sam Al said, "Solidarity and good cooperation between the party working group and members of the Sihanoukville Provincial Party Committee at all levels, serving the people responsibly in accordance with the policies and good deeds of party officials. "It is an important factor in gaining the trust of the people and a key factor in the victory of the Cambodian People's Party."
He encouraged all members to continue this wonderful tradition and work together to serve the people to the best of their ability.
He said that the victory that the CPP has won in every election is not only a victory on the ballot, but a victory for the entire Cambodian people.
The Chairman of the Working Group commended all the working group and the members of the Cambodian People's Party in Sihanoukville for their hard work, dedication, physical strength, mental strength and budget for the cause of the people.
