He mentioned many important achievements that Sihanoukville has achieved to the people under the high support of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, including the construction of road infrastructure and the construction of Sihanoukville. The Multi-Purpose Special Economic Zone has a land use master plan and a development plan for the Sihanoukville Multi-Purpose Special Economic Zone.
He also mentioned the many potentials that Sihanoukville has, including ports, islands with tourism potential, highways, airports, power plants, and Sihanoukville as one of the most potential tourist destinations.
Separately, on the afternoon of October 16, 2022, Mr. Say Sam Al also met with the Party Youth Working Group, the Women's Movement, the Commune / Sangkat Advocates, the Workers and the District Youth Leaders to disseminate the achievements and participate in disseminating the achievements. Those broadly. "We are all not only party members in the structure, but also active party propagandists," he said.
