He added that condominiums are being bought a lot from foreigners, but now almost 40% of local customers, mostly young people, have bought a lot of condominiums, which shows the growth of the domestic market for condominiums.
Bun Ches, developer of Mekong Tower condominiums, said that the price of expensive condominiums has dropped (not sold out, no customers), but for affordable condominiums, there is still a normal buying and selling trend, so it can be concluded that the current condominium market is still in good condition. Through subscriptions from foreign and local customers, between 30-35% are local customers.
