Through a message on social media, Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated: "I would like to express my deepest condolences to the families who lost their children and loved ones in the accident that sank the ferry carrying students from school. The house was in Kampong Phnom commune, Leuk Dek district, Kandal province, on the night of October 13, 2022, which caused the emergency death at the hospital.
Samdech has ordered all relevant authorities to continue to search for the victims and to help the relatives of the dead and the victims in the most difficult time. At the same time, Samdech called on people, especially those living along the river, to be very careful when the flood situation is increasing.
