Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen stated: "I would like to express my deepest condolences to the families who lost their children and grandchildren in the accident of the ferry carrying students from school. The house is in Kampong Phnom commune, Leuk Dek district, Kandal province on the night of October 13, 2022. ”
In addition to their condolences, Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit also assigned the Cambodian Red Cross team led by Ms. Pum Chantyny, Secretary General of the Cambodian Red Cross, and Ms. Men Neary Sopheak, First Deputy Secretary General of the Cambodian Red Cross. Food and suffixes for the funeral of the 11 children in each family, including: 100 kg of rice, 5 cases of noodles, 50 cans of fish, 5 cases of orange juice and 5 million riels.
