(Kandal): With the deepest emotion with the families of the victims, Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen sent CRC officials to bring food and money to share the sad death with the families of the children. The 11 people who died in the boat sinking incident in Leuk Dek district, Kandal province.
