She also pointed out that in addition to being shocked by this incident, Samdech Kittipritthbandit also assigned Ms. Pum Chantyny, she and her colleagues to bring food and money to share the grief and share the hardships with the family of the deceased all night. Through this gesture, it is clear that the spirit and concern of Samdech Kittipritthbandit, who is nicknamed the humanitarian mother to the families of the victims.
