Watch the full video below: Minister of Social Affairs: The Royal Government is developing a cash subsidy program to help poor people across the country
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, shared his experience and work of the Ministry of Social Affairs on the cash support program provided to poor families and people living near the poverty line. So far, he said, the government has spent nearly $ 1 billion on cash subsidies across the country.
The Minister of Social Affairs made the remarks while meeting with Mr. Masagos Zulkifli, Minister of Social Affairs and Family Development of the Republic of Singapore at the Ministry of Social Affairs on the morning of October 14, 2022.
He added that the Royal Government has recently decided to organize and launch the "Cash Subsidy Program for Vulnerable Families During Inflation Pressure", a special social assistance program aimed at helping to absorb the pressure from the rise. High levels of inflation at one time and provide vulnerable households across Cambodia that will be clearly and accurately identified.
The Minister said that the target population of low-income and vulnerable people who qualify to meet the diagnostic criteria of vulnerable families across the country will be assessed through telephone and tablet interviews. By local authorities and with the support of volunteer forces under the leadership and management of the Ministry of Planning and with the coordination of the National Council for Social Protection.
Mr. Masagos Zulkifli, Minister of Social Affairs and Family Development of the Republic of Singapore, expressed his pleasure to meet with Mr. Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs to share work on development and help the poor and people living near the poverty line. .
The Minister of Social Affairs and Family Development of the Republic of Singapore said that Singapore has a poor population and lives close to the poverty line like other countries, but he does not allow those target people to come to him. Go to those target people to solve problems and help in reality.
