Two roads in Phnom Penh were repaired and AC rubber foundation was completed on October 13
(Phnom Penh): Two sections of National Road No. 2 and Sisowath Quay, which the working group of the Department of Public Works and Transport of Phnom Penh, in accordance with the instructions of Mr. Khuong Sreng, Phnom Penh Governor, have already repaired the foundation and AC rubber. And on October 13, 2022.
Phnom Penh Capital Administration officials said in the morning of October 13 that in accordance with the instructions of Mr. Khuong Sreng, on October 1, the team of the Department of Public Works and Transport opened the ground to repair the foundation and AC rubber on the piece. National Road No. 2 is 4 and a half kilometers long and 18 meters wide, from the flyover to the Preah Noray roundabout (Phnom Penh-Kandal border).
The construction was completed on September 30, 2022, and now the team is working on the traffic. As for Sisowath Quay, the work was carried out from the base of Chroy Changvar Bridge to the roundabout of Samdech Sang Chuon Nath by repairing and ironing AC rubber, and this work was completed on October 13.
Phnom Penh Capital Administration officials confirmed that the project to repair the foundation and AC rubber on these two roads is in the project to repair 56 roads of Phnom Penh Capital Administration to facilitate traffic for the people and to raise The beauty of Phnom Penh is more beautiful and attractive.
