(Battambang): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior and Chairman of the National Working Group for Battambang Province, on the morning of October 11, 2022, presided over the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of a dormitory building, library and other achievements. Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng Ta Kream High School is located in O'Pong Moan Village, Ta Kream Commune, Banan District, Battambang Province.
