The provincial administration emphasized that: "Due to the fact that the four roads above are very steep and long roads are not suitable for heavy vehicles to pass through. In this regard, in order to prevent traffic accidents at the above location, the provincial administration will set up a 2.3-meter-high barrier for passing vehicles, warning signs and prohibited signs on Street 801, 821, 823 and Street 827. .
