The Women's Forum Steering Committee consists of a total of 284 blind and group representatives and members. The Women's Forum Committee works in five areas: education, health, employment, economics and law, with the aim of promoting rights and eliminating violence against women with disabilities, encouraging women with disabilities to participate in training Have a job, a job and a decent living.
