At around 12:10, the military police used specialized measures to detain a 24-year-old male suspect, Yi Pheng, at the above location and rescued a 34-year-old female victim, Nguyen Chi Ming Ngang. While the experts were questioning the suspect, E Pheng suddenly realized that some other accomplices had stolen the car and fled from the above location.
