The meeting took place on the morning of October 11, 2022 at the meeting hall of the General Command of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces.
Cambodia, as the chair of ASEAN 2022, will host the 40th and 41st ASEAN Summits and Related Summits from 10-13 November 2022 in Phnom Penh in a live format. Cambodia will also host the second ASEAN Global Dialogue.
