According to Samdech Techo Prime Minister, the Law on the Organization and Functioning of the Council of Ministers clearly points to Article 20 in terminating the position of a member of the Royal Government. This article states that "the Prime Minister proposes to the King to terminate the position of a member of the Royal Government by Royal Decree."
