Samdech Techo Hun Sen continued that because those groups lacked knowledge, they were imprisoned and fled the country and accused of being dictators. He added that more should be learned in order to reach power in the next world and not get too caught up in gambling. This is the prince's good intention for the foolish group.
Please be reminded that at the request of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on October 08, 2022, Mr. Veng Sakhon was issued a Royal Decree terminating his position by His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of Cambodia. Veng Sakhon from the Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries.
