(Phnom Penh): On the morning of October 11, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presided over the graduation ceremony for Phnom Penh International University (PPIU) students after their successful graduation. Tough.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen has always been honored to preside over the graduation ceremony for PPIU University students to encourage graduates. Samdech Techo has already presided over the graduation ceremony of PPIU University 5 times already.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for more than 1 hour and 40 minutes, the following are the main contents of Samdech Techo:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanks the Supreme Court for acquitting Ms. Kolap's husband from charges.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen considers the case of Mrs. Tep Kolap and Tycoon Kok An to be unfair
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech has produced 25 watches for distribution to ASEAN leaders and dialogue partners attending the ASEAN Summit and related meetings.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the suspension of the Royal Water Festival was not due to the Royal Government's lack of money, but due to the busy schedule of the ASEAN Summit and related meetings.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that only 19 people were infected with Kovid today.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the 19 epidemic of Kovid has changed the attitude of educators with the participation of parents, not just teachers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that knowledge is better than jewelry than body.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed the Minister of Education to consider providing education to migrant youth and children to work.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs the Ministry of Labor and the Ministry of Education to consider children following their parents to work in Thailand for education.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen congratulates all PPIU University students who graduated and received their degrees today.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advises educational institutions not to give up short skills training.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the new Article 119 of the Constitution stipulates the formation of the Royal Government, not the removal of senior officials.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it was decided to appoint Mr. Veng Sakhon as the Deputy Prime Minister
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that the film "Son under the full moon" was shot only 30 percent, costing $ 2.5 million. Samdech Techo confirmed that the film is planned to cost about $ 6 million and does not use the national budget.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the film "Son under the light of the full moon" is the story of the nation's history, not just the character of Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanks the French team and lawyers for their hard work in defending the case of Sam Rainsy in France.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the fact that Samdech followed Sam Rainsy's complaint to France required the cleanliness of Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the French court for providing justice to Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the announcement of the success of the Sam Rainsy Group in the lawsuit of Samdech is a success in mind.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech's desire for this lawsuit is not to get Sam Rainsy money, but what Samdech wants is to be clean from Sam Rainsy's accusations.
