Russia has fired a total of at least 75 missiles into Ukrainian territory, according to the Ukrainian military. Ukrainian President Vladimir Putin has claimed that it is targeting Ukraine's energy infrastructure. According to the Ukrainian prime minister, 11 major infrastructure sites in eight regions and in the capital Kiev were damaged in the Russian attack on Monday.
