The Ambassador assessed Cambodia's position on these two issues during a courtesy call and discussion with Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen on Monday morning, October 10, 2022.
Eang Sophalleth, Samdech Techo's personal assistant, said the ambassador praised Hun Sen's decision against Russia's aggression and its involvement in resolving Myanmar's crisis.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen reiterated that Russia's invasion of Ukraine was one thing, but excessive sanctions affected not only Russia, but Europe as well as the whole world, including Cambodia.
Samdech Techo added that this matter should be reviewed.
Please note that Cambodia's position has always been opposed to Russia's invasion of Ukraine. But Samdech Techo also objected to the excessive sanctions on Russia.
Mr. Stephen Enton Messerre expressed this commitment during a courtesy call and discussion with Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia on Monday morning, October 10, 2022.
