(Phnom Penh): General Ith Sarath, Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Joint Chiefs of Staff of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, on October 10, 2022, continued to bring a winter coat, a gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittiprittbandit. Bun Rany Hun Sen distributed to units standing along the border line of the Special Military Zone and the Kandal-Kampong Chhnang Provincial Gendarmerie.
