On that occasion, General Ith Sarath also brought greetings and memories from Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen and thanked and appreciated the Armed Forces of all units. Dedicate physical and mental strength to perform tasks bravely in all circumstances, especially in peace, all forces always go down to save people from various natural disasters.
General Ith Sarath stated that in the last phase, the Armed Forces has become a key force in the successful fight against the spread of Kovid 19, which is a sign of respect and command. Appointment of the head of the Royal Government to manage the situation.
At the same time, the General continued that Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit always pay close attention to the well-being and well-being of soldiers at all stages. In addition, Samdech also helped build houses for the families of the army and veterans, as well as donated a lot of money and materials to the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces.
General Ith Sarath emphasized that in order to reciprocate the attention of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, all troops must remember this great merit, especially to continue to support Samdech Techo as a candidate for director. Ministers of all terms and Dr. Hun Manet as the future Prime Minister.
In addition, the General reminded the Armed Forces to continue to promote a patriotic conscience, loyal to the Royal Government, join forces to unite the nation, protect peace, prevent and timely suppress any unscrupulous people who have a plan to destroy peace and continue. Preserve all the achievements born from the win-win policy of the peaceful leader Samdech Techo Hun Sen to bring more progress and prosperity for the people and society.
