According to Mr. Soeun Vorak, he also had malaria in the past, but with timely treatment and know how to prevent acne, with the help of volunteers and health officials, he and the same group of hikers can continue. This business has come to this day. Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration informs about the requirements and guidelines on business management of casinos, hotels, restaurants, condominiums and some business owners
(Preah Sihanouk): The Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration has issued guidelines on the management of casinos, hotels, restaurants, condominiums and other business owners, outlining some of the amendments and requirements. This is according to the instructions received by Fresh News on October 08, 2022.
The issuance of this instruction is due to the fact that in the past, the Sihanoukville Provincial Administration has observed the location of businesses, casinos, hotels, restaurants, condominiums and some businesses after obtaining business licenses from the Royal Government or the Ministry. The authorities have not yet informed the provincial administration or the relevant authorities about the operation of their business and have not yet raised the name tag of their business location.
The Sihanoukville provincial administration added that some locations were fenced off, making it difficult for authorities to inspect each location, and on the other hand, creating conditions for opportunists to commit crimes such as detention to exploit forces. Labor, human trafficking, sex work, and crimes against Cambodian law.
In this regard, in order to maintain security, public order and to manage the business location of casinos, hotels, restaurants, condominiums and business owners well and in accordance with the laws or regulations, the Sihanoukville Provincial Administration would like to advise the business owners of casinos, hotels, restaurants. Common residential buildings and business owners in Preah Sihanouk Province as follows:
* First, the casino owner must apply for a permit to open his business location from the Sihanoukville Provincial Administration before applying for a license from the Ministry of Economy and Finance.
* Second, the business owner must display a name tag about his business that is larger than the foreign letters (half Khmer letters) and the Khmer letters must be in the top row correctly in accordance with the content of the license and display All licenses at the reception
* Third: Business owners of casinos, hotels, restaurants, dormitories or any other person must not keep their passports or work permits or identification documents of their employees. In the event that the competent authority finds that the passport or work permit or identification document of the employee is kept by the business owner or any person, he / she will be responsible before the law in force.
* Fourth: The business location must be open without covering or enclosing the net or barbed wire fence and must not block the freedom of workers to enter and exit.
* Fifth, the business owner must prepare the list of workers and payroll clearly according to the employment contract.
* Seventh: To conduct business in accordance with the labor law and other legal documents in Cambodia consistently.
