The National Bank of Cambodia will extend the official exchange rate from October 18, 2022.
(Phnom Penh): The National Bank of Cambodia (NBC) has issued an announcement on extending the official exchange rate release time to banking and financial institutions, companies, enterprises and the public from October 18, 2022.
According to the announcement received by Fresh News on October 8, 2022, "In order to facilitate the registration and payment of faster and more efficient, the National Bank of Cambodia will increase the release "The official exchange rate at the end of the transaction day, keeping the exchange rate released in the morning from October 18, 2022 onwards."
Please be informed that the exchange rate at the end of the transaction day will be the same as the exchange rate the next morning, as these two exchange rates are calculated from the average exchange rate of the interbank market exchange rate that the banking institution And day trading finance on the National Bank of Cambodia (NBCP) platform.
