(Siem Reap): A four-and-a-half-year-old police officer serving as the Deputy Chief of the Identification Office of the Siem Reap Provincial Police committed suicide by attempting to commit suicide with a handgun. This incident caused a surprise on October 7, 2022, at the victim's house in the 8th city, Thnal village, Sra Nge commune, Siem Reap city, Siem Reap province.
According to Seng Sam An, 63, the victim's biological father, Seng Wutty was a good joker and did not have any mental or physical illness. But corpses often have conflicts with their wives, as they like to go out drinking regularly.
On the night of October 6, 2022, it was not known whether Seng Vuthy was drunk or not. Suddenly, at around 0:15 am on the 7th, he received information from the neighbors that His name is Seng Vuthy, he used a handgun and shot himself in the head, causing serious injuries. He was sent to the rescue.
According to witnesses, the neighbors also claimed that in the past, the victim had frequent verbal conflicts with his wife because his wife was jealous of her husband drinking too late at night.
Immediately after the incident, the family sent the victim to the Siem Reap Provincial Referral Hospital, but due to the seriousness of the situation, he was sent to Calmette Hospital. Based on the hearing of the relatives of the victims, witnesses, rescuers, photos of the victims received from relatives and based on the evidence seized from the scene, the authorities concluded that this case is a real suicide (suicide). Yes.
