This statement by General Khieu Sopheak was made after the meeting to review the results of the campaign against all forms of human trafficking, labor trafficking, sex work and all kinds of illegal gambling, as well as the inspection of foreigners and Foreign labor under the chairmanship of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, this morning, October 7, 2022.
