In particular, in the case of the authorities to close and instruct the owners of the volleyball table in the past, the General said that the measures of the Ministry of Interior requires local authorities to apply only to the owners of volleyball tables. Bet on money only. For volleyball tables that allow people to play for health is allowed to run normally.
