Myanmar has been in turmoil since the military overthrew Aung San Suu Kyi's civilian government and sparked armed resistance across the country. Last month, at least 11 schoolchildren were killed in an airstrike on a village in Sagang, while the military claimed it was a targeted operation by insurgents hiding in the area.
