This incident happened at 2:15 AM on October 6, 2022 at Soksan Clinic in Prey Khla Village, Kraol Kor Commune, Svay Chrum District, Svay Rieng Province.
Currently, the police are conducting a search to arrest the suspects and bring them to justice.
