Notice! Authorities temporarily suspend traffic for all types of heavy trucks on National Road 95 in Chey Sen District, Preah Vihear Province.
(Preah Vihear): The Department of Public Works and Transport of Preah Vihear Province has announced a temporary suspension of traffic for all types of heavy trucks on National Road 95 in Chey Sen District, Preah Vihear Province.
According to the announcement of the Department of Public Works and Transport of Preah Vihear Province, obtained by Fresh News on October 7, 2022, it is confirmed that the flood situation in Stung Sen River has continued to reach the emergency level, causing roads and bridges. Can not withstand heavy trucks.
Therefore, the Department of Public Works and Transport of Preah Vihear Province would like to temporarily close all traffic on all types of heavy trucks on National Road 95 from km 40 to km 41 in Putra village, Putra district. Chey Sen from the date of this announcement until the announcement again to keep roads and bridges from collapsing and ensure safe traffic.
