(Phnom Penh): The National Assembly of Cambodia extended its warmest congratulations to the National People's Congress (NPC) as well as the Government and people of the People's Republic of China on the occasion of the opening ceremony. The 20th National Congress of the Communist Party of China will be held on October 16, 2022.
The National Assembly of Cambodia considers the 20th General Assembly of the Communist Party of China to be of great importance to the people and the Communist Party of China, especially at a time when the People's Republic of China has been developing a prosperous socio-economic prestige and social construction. Popular according to Chinese characteristics.
The National Assembly of Cambodia firmly believes that "the General Assembly on this occasion will set out new strategies and new directions with a strong will and a high level of commitment to accelerate the development and promotion." "Let the country and the people of China move towards greater prosperity."
"We appreciate and commend the great national achievements in all areas that the Chinese leadership and people have achieved in the past under the right and wise leadership of the National Assembly," he said. "The Chinese Communist Party has made China the world's second largest economy and lifted the Chinese people out of poverty since 2002."
In addition, China's development and indispensable core role have brought peace, stability, prosperity, progress and development both regionally and globally.
The National Assembly added that the Cambodian people support the one-China policy and are committed to continuing to assist each other in a good partnership as a good friend in all difficult circumstances to address the challenges of climate change and climate change. Rapid change of world political situation.
At the same time, the National Assembly of Cambodia and the people of Cambodia wished the General Assembly a successful and fruitful outcome for the People's Republic of China to achieve greater and more recent success, especially the achievement of goals. In building a modern, prosperous and prosperous socialist country, democracy, culture, prosperity and harmony by 2049.
The National Assembly would like to wish the traditional friendship, solidarity and good cooperation in all fields between the parliament, the government and the people of the two countries, Cambodia and China, be strengthened and continuously expanded both now and in the future.
After the water level reaches the emergency level, today, Pursat provincial leaders visited the Khmer Muslims and inspected the flood situation on the Pursat River.
